From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gustavo Morinaga <me@gustavomorinaga.dev>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:30:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Killzone port on v0.19.0: the Vulkan backend stays the
 port's

ps3recomp v0.19.0 changed libs/video/rsx_vulkan_backend.c in four pull
requests: #614 (a resizable window with its aspect kept and
PS3RECOMP_FULLSCREEN), #681 (R32F and RGBA32F colour targets in the
engine), #682 (stale engine releases kept off live Vulkan objects) and the
depth clamp of SET_ZMIN_MAX_CONTROL. The port's own patches rewrote the same
window, present and engine code (the window and display modes, the present
and its steps, the temporal upscalers), so as on v0.18.0 (patch 0001) the
series goes on the backend as v0.18.0 had it: this puts the file back, and
every later patch applies to it unchanged. The four are to be brought in
one by one as patches of their own, each checked in the game. Applied
first, before every other patch.
---
 libs/video/rsx_vulkan_backend.c | 170 ++++------------------------------------
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+), 156 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libs/video/rsx_vulkan_backend.c b/libs/video/rsx_vulkan_backend.c
index f78c66f28fc6336f02cc8ba63eba4a8c8bb5642a..db64302e4d6667fd2cf718546db529ecca23df49 100644
--- a/libs/video/rsx_vulkan_backend.c
+++ b/libs/video/rsx_vulkan_backend.c
@@ -214,7 +214,6 @@ typedef struct vk_state {
     int              eng_active;      /* the register-file engine drives us */
     int              bc_ok;           /* textureCompressionBC enabled       */
     int              depth_bounds_ok; /* depthBounds enabled                */
-    int              depth_clamp_ok;  /* depthClamp enabled                 */
     int              indep_blend_ok;  /* independentBlend: per-target MRT state */
     u32              max_dim;         /* maxImageDimension2D of the device  */
     int              windowed;
@@ -1750,11 +1749,8 @@ static void vk_window_open(const char* title)
         VK_LOG("window disabled, continuing headless: SDL video init failed: %s\n", SDL_GetError());
         return;
     }
-    /* Resizable and maximizable; F11 or Alt+Enter switches to borderless fullscreen and back. The frame keeps its
-     * aspect ratio inside whatever size the window has (vk_window_fit). */
